WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:05.371
&gt;&gt;&gt; DOZENS OF FORMER REPUBLICAN
AND DEMOCRATIC OFFICIALS ARE

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:09.042
ANNOCING A NEW NATIONAL
POLITICAL THIRD PARTY CALLED

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.144
FORWARD.
IN AN OP-ED IN "THE WASHINGTON

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:14.948
POST," KEY MEMBERS WRITE THEIR
GOAL IS TO, QUOTE, BUILD A NEW

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.950
UNIFYING POLITICAL PARTY FOR THE
MAJORITY OF AMERICANS WHO WANT

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.821
TO MOVE PAST DIVISIVENESS AND
REJECT EXTREMISM.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:26.726
OUR NEXT GUEST CO-WROTE THE
OP-ED, ANDREW YANG, FORMER

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:36.903
DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE AND
CHRISTINE TODD WHITTEMAN, FORME

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.672
EPA LEADER.
THIS SO RARELY WORKS, SO WHY

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:44.644
WILL YOUR EFFORT WORK?
&gt;&gt; WE'RE IN A DIFFERENT TIME

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.479
NOW --
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE APPETITE --

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:52.685
&gt;&gt; GO AHEAD, CHRISTINE.
&gt;&gt; 50 -- OKAY.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.621
WHEN YOU HAVE 50% OF THE
AMERICAN PEOPLE SAYING THAT THEY

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.892
ARE REGISTERED INDEPENDENT OF
THE VOTERS OF REGISTERED VOTERS,

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.762
A VOTER INDEPENDENT, PEOPLE ARE
SICK AND TIRED OF WHAT THEY'RE

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:05.698
SEEING IN WASHINGTON AND THE
FACT THAT NOTHING MAJOR IS

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:10.103
GETTING DONE, IT IS FRUSTRATING.
WE HAVE BIG PROBLEMS AND WE WANT

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.672
TO SEE THEM RESOLVED.
WE NEED TO GET BACK TO A TIME

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.974
WHEN PEOPLE WILL TALK TO ONE
ANOTHER AND WE'RE TALKING ABOUT

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.877
BRINGING PEOPLE TOGETHER, YOU
CAN KEEP YOUR PARTY LABEL,

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.913
REPUBLICAN, DEMOCRAT,
INDEPENDENT, DOESN'T MATTER, BUT

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:24.417
LET'S WORK TOGETHER TO SOLVE
PROBLEMS, LET'S ELECT THOSE

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.452
CANDIDATES WHO UNDERSTAND THAT
OUR ELECTORAL PROCESS IS THE

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:29.022
BEST IN THE WORLD, AND IT IS
SECURE.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:32.425
AND WE NEED TO PICK THOSE
CANDIDATES WHO WILL SAY I'LL

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.561
WORK ACROSS THE AISLE BECAUSE I
WANT TO GET THINGS DONE.

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:38.464
&gt;&gt; SO, ANDREW, I WANT TO CORRECT
MYSELF, I SAID IT SO RARELY

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.834
WORKS, IT ACTUALLY NEVER WORKED,
TO BE CLEAR.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:45.672
LET'S TALK ABOUT THE OBSTACLES
HERE AND ONE MIGHT BE THE

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:48.308
POLICIES.
WHERE, BECAUSE, LOOK, THERE ARE

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:51.211
SIGNIFICANT DIFFERENCES,
POLICY-WISE, BETWEEN DEMOCRATS

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.479
AND REPUBLICANS.
WHAT ARE YOUR POLICIES GOING TO

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:57.784
BE THAT YOU CAN ACTUALLY AGREE
ON?

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:01.955
&gt;&gt; 62% OF AMERICANS NOW WANT A
THIRD PARTY.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.057
A RECORD HIGH.
BECAUSE THEY CAN SEE THAT OUR

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:07.393
LEADERS AREN'T GETTING IT DONE.
WHEN YOU ASK ABOUT THE POLICY

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:12.699
GOALS, THE FACT IS THE MAJORITY
OF AMERICANS ACTUALLY AGREE ON

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:17.236
REALLY EVEN DIVISIVE ISSUES.
THE MOST DIVISIVE ISSUES OF THE

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:22.008
DAY LIKE ABORTION OR FIREARMS.
THERE IS ACTUALLY A COMMON SENSE

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.577
COALITION POSITION ON THESE
ISSUES AND JUST ABOUT EVERY

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.447
OTHER ISSUE UNDER THE SUN.
THE TAG LINE ON THE PARTY IS IT

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.515
IS NOT LEFT OR RIGHT, IT'S
FORWARD.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.852
AND WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT WHAT
THAT WOULD MEAN ON EACH ISSUE,

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:36.322
ACTUALLY THE POLICY BECOMES
PRETTY CLEAR WHEN YOU JUST ASK

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.925
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE, THE
AMERICAN PEOPLE ARE FED UP BY

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:42.195
THE FACT THAT OUR LEADERS AREN'T
ACTUALLY RESPONSIVE TO THE NEEDS

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.530
OR THE WILL OF COMMUNITIES
AROUND THE COUNTRY.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:49.502
&gt;&gt; SO, GOVERNOR, LET'S TAKE THAT
ISSUE.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:53.239
GUNS, FOR INSTANCE, WHAT WOULD
THE POLICY BE THAT WOULD UNITE

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:57.176
ENOUGH PEOPLE TO MAKE A THIRD
PARTY SUCCESSFUL?

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:59.646
&gt;&gt; WELL, FIRST OF ALL,
UNDERSTAND WHAT WE'RE GOING TO

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.348
BE DOING IS HOLDING A SERIES OF
LISTENING SESSIONS AROUND THE

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.150
COUNTRY TO TALK TO PEOPLE ABOUT
THAT VERY ISSUE.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.320
BUT I CAN TELL YOU RIGHT NOW
THAT YOU'VE SEEN IN EVERY POLL,

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.222
THE MAJORITY OF THE AMERICAN
PEOPLE BELIEVE THERE SHOULD BE

00:03:10.222 --> 00:03:12.792
SOME KINDS OF RESTRICTIONS, A
WAITING PERIOD.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.527
THERE SHOULD BE A BACKGROUND
CHECK.

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:16.896
FRANKLY YOU DON'T WANT TO PUT
GUNS IN THE HANDS OF PEOPLE WHO

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:19.432
HAD NO TRAINING.
SO YOU -- PEOPLE WOULD LIKE TO

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:21.367
SEE SOME TRAINING.
THOSE ARE THE ISSUES AROUND

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.070
WHICH WE CAN COALESCE.
WE'RE NOT GOING TO SOLVE

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.605
EVERYTHING.
WE'RE NOT GOING TO SOLVE

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:27.674
EVERYBODY'S PROBLEM AND YOU'RE
NOT GOING TO MAKE EVERYBODY

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:29.309
HAPPY.
AS YOU RIGHTLY POINT OUT, THERE

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:31.611
IS A GREAT DEAL OF DIVISION ON
SOME OF THESE ISSUES.

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:35.915
BUT WHEN YOU PEELING BACK THAT
ONION, IT IS AMAZING HOW MUCH

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:39.485
COMMON GROUND YOU CAN FIND AND
THEN YOU HAVE A POSITION FROM

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:41.621
WHICH TO MOVE FORWARD.
AND THAT'S WHAT WE NEED TO DO.

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:44.624
ONCE YOU START THAT PROCESS,
THERE IS GOING TO BE NO STOPPING

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:50.296
IT, QUITE FRANKLY.
&gt;&gt; ANDREW, GUNS, SOME AGREEMENT

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:53.099
IN CONGRESS RECENTLY ON THIS.
IS THAT NOT ENOUGH?

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:56.636
&gt;&gt; WELL, WHEN YOU TALK ABOUT THE
NEED FOR A POLITICAL

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:00.873
REALIGNMENT, THE FACT IS ABRAHAM
LINCOLN WON AS A THIRD PARTY

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:05.244
CANDIDATE WITH 39% OF THE VOTE.
WE CAN ALL TELL THAT THIS SYSTEM

00:04:05.244 --> 00:04:08.915
